            %p Using this we compute as follows:
            #eq:CorrectionTermForCountertermsVanishesAsCutoffIsRemoved.maruku-equation
              %span.maruku-eq-number (19)
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
