                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    \\begin{aligned}
                    \\Delta_{F,m}(x)
                    \&amp; =
                    \\underset{ {\epsilon \in (0,\infty)} \atop {\epsilon \to 0} }{\lim}
                    \\frac{+i}{(2\pi)^{p+1}}
                    \\int
                    \\int_{-\infty}^\infty
                    \\frac{
                    e^{i k_\mu x^\mu}
                    }{
                    \- k_\mu k^\mu - \left( \tfrac{m c}{\hbar} \right)^2 \pm i \epsilon
